        "display_unit": "function_symmetry_rewrite",
        "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\because\\ g(x)=f(x)+2\\\\\\therefore\\ g(-x)=f(-x)+2\\\\\\because\\ g\\text{ 是奇函数}\\\\\\therefore\\ g(-x)=f(-x)+2=-g(x)\\\\\\therefore\\ f(-x)+2=-\\left(f(x)+2\\right)\\\\\\therefore\\ f(-x)+2=-f(x)-2\\\\\\therefore\\ f(x)+f(-x)=-4\\end{gathered}$$",
